stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    state Moore_FSM {
        S0 : STATE0 / out=00
        S1 : STATE1 / out=01
        S2 : STATE2 / out=10
        S3 : STATE3 / out=11

        S0 --> S1 : input=1
        S0 --> S0 : input=0
        S1 --> S2 : input=1
        S1 --> S0 : input=0
        S2 --> S3 : input=1
        S2 --> S1 : input=0
        S3 --> S0 : input=1
        S3 --> S2 : input=0
    }

    state Mealy_FSM {
        A : STATE_A
        B : STATE_B

        A --> B : in=1 / out=1
        A --> A : in=0 / out=0
        B --> A : in=0 / out=1
        B --> B : in=1 / out=0
    }

    note right of Moore_FSM
        Output depends on STATE only
        always_ff for state register
        always_comb for next_state + output
    end note

    note right of Mealy_FSM
        Output depends on STATE + INPUT
        Faster response to input changes
    end note
